  {
   "key": "step script-gates/Code map is current",
   "hash": "d273ed7098ec9b99",
   "does": "Runs `make codemap-setup` and then scripts/check_codemap.sh with the venv interpreter on the Linux runner, so every push to main and every pull request fails while any code-map record is missing, empty or stale, has an unread re-check line, names a unit that no longer exists or cites a line number. The open-findings ratchet does not run here: its overlay (do_not_ship/codemap) is local only.",
